 "guideSteps": [
  "Create the character, take the board buffs (Alt+B).",
  "Talk to the Newbie Helper in the start town (right of the class master).",
  "Kill Gremlins until the Blue Gemstone drops; reach level 3+.",
  "Back to the Newbie Helper: beginner soulshots / spiritshots.",
  "Talk to the class master on the left (e.g. Grand Master Roien for human fighters): \"I brought the recommendation\".",
  "Choose to go to the Isle of Souls.",
  "Map -> World Info -> Quest tab: find \"Supply Check\".",
  "Talk to Marcela, accept Supply Check.",
  "Follow the quest markers (Alt+M, Tracking).",
  "Finish the chain (reach level 5): beginner armor (wooden light armor for fighters, leather robe for mystics).",
  "Hunt to level 6 if needed.",
  "Newbie Helper/Guide: shadow weapon with the coupons, chosen from the apprentice weapon warehouse (time-limited).",
  "Class change: buy it on the board (Career) or do the class quests. Party members can follow the leader's dialog."
